<title>POLAND: KREDYT BANK APRIL NET UP TO PLN 8.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>KREDYT BANK APRIL NET UP TO PLN 8.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  8.78 vs    1.26</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   15.20 vs    2.10</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 27.37 vs   11.64</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	31.60 vs   18.95</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL				     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 20.18 vs    7.54</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   34.20 vs   12.57</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 95.08 vs   41.97</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     115.80 vs   71.94</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Kredyt Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
